aylor Swift's record-breaking Eras Tour (2023-2024). Filmed during the Los Angeles shows, the film captures the tour's ten acts, each representing a different musical era from Swift's career. The film showcases over 40 songs, elaborate stage productions, and Swift's performance.\",\"genres\":[\"Music\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":776527,\"title\":\"Summer of Soul (...Or, When the Revolution Could Not Be Televised)\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8kNwhqUGvpzWJd60O1Qvb8G6psK.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1LYWnmr5K3Hs3XEZ323bY0dBZsK.jpg\",\"rating\":7.6,\"year\":2021,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"During the same summer as Woodstock, over 300,000 people attended the Harlem Cultural Festival, celebrating African American music and culture, and promoting Black pride and unity. The footage from the festival sat in a basement, unseen for over 50 years, keeping this incredible event in America's history lost — until now.\",\"genres\":[\"Music\",\"Documentary\",\"History\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":54518,\"title\":\"Justin Bieber: Never Say Never\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dGNMD5XTBQN3teIth21ohKOCJcR.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wsuO9N3t89buTgtzJ5vUMBCHBB6.jpg\",\"rating\":5.2,\"year\":2011,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Tells the story of Justin Bieber, the kid from Canada with the hair, the smile and the voice: It chronicles his unprecedented rise to fame, all the way from busking in the streets of Stratford, Canada to putting videos on YouTube to selling out Madison Square Garden in New York as the headline act during the My World Tour from 2010. It features Usher, Scooter Braun, Ludacris, Sean Kingston, Antonio \\\"L.A.\\\" Reid, Boyz II Men, Miley Cyrus, Jaden Smith, Justin's family members and parts of his crew and huge fanbase in a mix of interviews and guest performances.\",\"genres\":[\"Music\",\"Documentary\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":568332,\"title\":\