e - LA\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9pNGRpOOQpZtqMLncEcQDv86OkW.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4IMn2EqCBb4n4r6FODOP7fJQIdi.jpg\",\"rating\":8.8,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Purple colors the city of Los Angeles, as BTS brings their \\\"Permission to Dance\\\" concert to SoFi Stadium for the first time in two years. In a stadium radiating anticipation and cheer, splendid performances from \\\"On\\\" to \\\"Permission to Dance\\\" glorify the stage that now comes to life on screen. Be united once again by the power of music.\",\"genres\":[\"Music\",\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":290382,\"title\":\"Roger Waters: The Wall\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/oFPVC3ival04a9Yijm716QXOsCA.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qZaTgZlxa0Ot1k1HUCLle7nfqGR.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A concert film that the former Pink Floyd singer-songwriter made on various tour dates between 2010 and 2013, when he was playing his former group's 1980 double-album in its entirety.\",\"genres\":[\"Music\",\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":283559,\"title\":\"One Direction: Where We Are - The Concert Film\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8b8DHnN9R8lRMbflfnNAV87qGZQ.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/71jft7p3jnqrFTizptt5dbTK3gh.jpg\",\"rating\":8.3,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Where We Are: Live from San Siro Stadium features the entire 23 track concert filmed at San Siro Stadium in Milan in June 2014, as well as 24 minutes of bonus content including backstage footage of One Direction and their crew.\",\"genres\":[\"Music\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1445110,\"title\":\"Trailerpark: Goldener Schluss (Live in Berlin)\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1uT3zAUe4HC4oGjo4iQjQCQ0EQU.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cvhR6X7AevPctxAsC82fW6nN12C.jpg\",\"rating